Browser assets
--------------

Common UI (source: src/main/org/epics/archiverappliance/staticcontent/js/vendor;
WAR location: ui/comm/js/vendor):

  d3.min.js (D3 7.9.0): ISC; d3_license.txt
    dist/d3.min.js of the npm tarball d3-7.9.0.tgz. d3.SOURCE.txt beside the
    file records the tarball integrity and the SHA-256 of the file, and
    d3.LICENSE.txt beside it carries the same license text.

Default header images (source: src/main/org/epics/archiverappliance/staticcontent/img;
WAR location: ui/comm/img):

  archiverheader.svg holds the EPICS logo, on-screen RGB v03 in green,
    copied with its paths unchanged from
    https://epics-controls.org/download/documents/EPICS_logo_on_screen_(RGB).zip
    (vector/green_logo/EPICS_green_logo_rgb_v03.svg). The terms of use of the
    EPICS logo are at https://epics.anl.gov/docs/epics-logo.php.
  wordmark.svg and sitelogo.svg carry no third-party artwork. The text of all
    three images is set as outlines of Inter Display (SIL Open Font License 1.1).
  scripts/logo/ regenerates the three images; it carries the EPICS logo file
    above, unchanged, as epics-logo-green-rgb-v03.svg.

